caller-follows-pane

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Open tabs where the caller's pane is now: HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID and HERDR_PANE_ID are set once when a pane starts, so after pane move, or after the pane closes under a background agent, tabs landed in a workspace the user was not looking at.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream resolves the caller's pane through the daemon instead of trusting HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID.
